    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14411" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπροαίρ-ετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without set purpose, not
				deliberate,</i> of actions, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1135b10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.16.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				1.2.5
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
